 ("A nurse teaches one person with hypertension how to reduce salt intake. Which prevention level is this?","Primary prevention, because it aims to reduce future disease risk before complications occur.",["Secondary prevention through early case detection.","Tertiary prevention through rehabilitation after disability.","Primordial prevention through changing broad social conditions only."],"Risk-factor counseling before complications is primary prevention."),
