 ("A town has 40 existing cases of asthma among 2,000 residents on July 1. What is point prevalence?","40 / 2,000 = 2% of residents have asthma at that time.",["40 new cases per 2,000 person-years.","2,000 / 40 = 50%.","The number of asthma deaths in the town."],"Point prevalence counts all existing cases at a specified time divided by the population at that time."),
