 ("People who choose a wellness program are healthier than nonparticipants before it begins. What threat is likely?","Selection bias and confounding from baseline differences.",["Randomization.","Nondifferential measurement error only.","Loss to follow-up cannot affect results."],"Self-selection can make groups differ before exposure to the intervention."),
