 ("A policy is applied uniformly but its effect differs across groups. What should evaluation examine?","Whether barriers or baseline conditions create unequal benefits or harms.",["Only the overall mean.","Whether subgroup data should be hidden.","Whether evaluation can be stopped."],"Equity assessment checks how effects are distributed across populations."),
 ("A clinic offers post-exposure prophylaxis after a known exposure. Which description best fits?","An intervention to prevent disease after exposure but before or early in disease development.",["Rehabilitation after permanent disability.","Screening for an unrelated condition.","A measure of prevalence."],"Post-exposure prophylaxis aims to avert illness after a specific exposure."),
